DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
11356::$$$message_0091_0000_0000$$$::"It must make you anxious having two or three freeloaders." [lr]::
11357::$$$message_0091_0000_0001$$$::Rider says. It's already been a month since Rider started working part-time at the antique shop.::
11358::$$$message_0091_0001_0000$$$::"...Come to think of it, I wonder what happened since then."[lr]::
11359::$$$message_0091_0001_0001$$$::It's a den-like store that has an eccentric selection from all around the world. I'm sure all kinds of customers come to such a diverse store.::
11360::$$$message_0091_0002_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
11361::$$$message_0091_0002_0001$$$::A different dimension is born right away within the shopping district.[lr]::
11362::$$$message_0091_0002_0002$$$::The surrounding people at the store are just watching from afar, without cutting in.::
11363::$$$message_0091_0003_0000$$$::"Well, well. To think that the youngest of the infamous Gorgon sisters is tending to a store at such a place."[lr]::
11364::$$$message_0091_0003_0001$$$::"You are as infamous as I am.[lr]::
11365::$$$message_0091_0003_0002$$$::On top of that, you are bringing shame upon yourself with that bulky and suffocating outfit."::
11366::$$$message_0091_0004_0000$$$::"Heh, it seems that it is difficult to understand the beauty of dignified purple with your shabby monster-like taste."[lr]::
11367::$$$message_0091_0004_0001$$$::"This is my work uniform."::
11368::$$$message_0091_0005_0000$$$::"Yes, it looks good on your gigantic figure.[lr]::
11369::$$$message_0091_0005_0001$$$::Geez, I wonder what kind of things you eat to end up like that."[lr]::
11370::$$$message_0091_0005_0002$$$::"..."::
11371::$$$message_0091_0006_0000$$$::"Even if you drank nectar or ate ambrosia, you wouldn't be like a Lebanese cedar that stands up straight in the air.[lr]::
11372::$$$message_0091_0006_0001$$$::I bet you don't even have a lover, do you?"[lr]::
11373::$$$message_0091_0006_0002$$$::"Oh, are you acting like a newlywed even though you're a divorcee?"[lr]::
11374::$$$message_0091_0006_0003$$$::"..."::
11375::$$$message_0091_0007_0000$$$::"Hold on! Calm down, you two!"[lr]::
11376::$$$message_0091_0007_0001$$$::I step in between them with a headache for the sake of the world, the people, and Mount Miyama.::
11377::$$$message_0091_0008_0000$$$::"Shirou[line len=2]"[lr]::
11378::$$$message_0091_0008_0001$$$::"You're in the way, boy."[lr]::
11379::$$$message_0091_0008_0002$$$::Strict voices that stab into me from both sides.[lr]::
11380::$$$message_0091_0008_0003$$$::An atmosphere where jokes and flattery don't exist at all.[lr]::
11381::$$$message_0091_0008_0004$$$::...Ugh, I bet I'll end up a miserable corpse if I make a wrong move.::
11382::$$$message_0091_0009_0000$$$::"...Ahem.[lr]::
11383::$$$message_0091_0009_0001$$$::I've been watching over you two so that no sparks fly, but it seems like the whole store would burn down like this.[lr]::
11384::$$$message_0091_0009_0002$$$::Why are you both so feisty?"[lr]::
11385::$$$message_0091_0009_0003$$$::I warn them that fighting isn't good to the best of my ability.::
11386::$$$message_0091_0010_0000$$$::"I am merely a customer. If there were a problem, wouldn't it be that rude clerk's fault?"[lr]::
11387::$$$message_0091_0010_0001$$$::"Then, Rider is at fault."::
11388::$$$message_0091_0011_0000$$$::"You heard him, Rider. You say some good things once in a while, boy."[lr]::
11389::$$$message_0091_0011_0001$$$::"Yeah. I get how you feel, but you have to treat any customer with respect if you're an employee, no matter how they may be. [cacheimage storage=キャスターローブ無し01d(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][textoff][chgfg time=200 storage=キャスターローブ無し01d(中)][wait canskip=0 time=300]Just think that you were captured by something troublesome, endure it with a smile[line len=2]mrrghgrblrghlrmrhliblrgh!?[se storage=se350.wav][quake vmax=20 hmax=20 time=2000][wvl]"[sestop storage=se350.wav time=1000 nowait=1][wait canskip=0 time=800][clfg][dash page=back mx=27 opacity=255 layer=base irot=0.02 cx=400 imag=1.2 time=400 cy=300 mag=1.6 my=-205 storage=i骨董品店 rot=0.02 accel=2][transex time=300][se volume=40 storage=se072.wav][wdash canskip=0][shock vmax=30 time=600 count=6][se storage=se211.wav]::
11390::$$$message_0091_0012_0000$$$::"That is true... Ahh..."[lr]::
11391::$$$message_0091_0012_0001$$$::"That is quite some way to treat a customer.[lr]::
11392::$$$message_0091_0012_0002$$$::Welcoming a customer with a sigh, is that the specialty of this store?"[lr]::
11393::$$$message_0091_0012_0003$$$::"Oh, don't bully her too much, Caster."::
11394::$$$message_0091_0013_0000$$$::They insult each other whenever they are in each other's presence.[lr]::
11395::$$$message_0091_0013_0001$$$::There aren't any Servants that get along in the first place...with the exception of one's one-sided proposal.::
11396::$$$message_0091_0014_0000$$$::"Are you not feeling well, Rider?"[lr]::
11397::$$$message_0091_0014_0001$$$::I thought she was working more resolutely, but she seems to be carrying some weight on her shoulders.[lr]::
11398::$$$message_0091_0014_0002$$$::I wonder if her part-time job here is that rough.::
11399::$$$message_0091_0015_0000$$$::"Is your work not going well?"[lr]::
11400::$$$message_0091_0015_0001$$$::"No, the owner thinks highly of me.[lr]::
11401::$$$message_0091_0015_0002$$$::And that it's been ten years since the shop and storehouse has been this cleaned up."::
11402::$$$message_0091_0016_0000$$$::She has strength, so she can pick up big furniture easily.[lr]::
11403::$$$message_0091_0016_0001$$$::She's rather clumsy despite being oversensitive, so I'm worried that she might break some expensive antique.::
11404::$$$message_0091_0017_0000$$$::"Then, why are you so depressed?"[lr]::
11405::$$$message_0091_0017_0001$$$::"I'm here to talk if there's something on your mind."[lr]::
11406::$$$message_0091_0017_0002$$$::"...I have a lot of things on my mind.[lr]::
11407::$$$message_0091_0017_0003$$$::The customers that come here seem to be[line len=2]"::
11408::$$$message_0091_0018_0000$$$::"Excuse me."[lr]::
11409::$$$message_0091_0018_0001$$$::"Welcome."[lr]::
11410::$$$message_0091_0018_0002$$$::"Do you have any chinaware here?[lr]::
11411::$$$message_0091_0018_0003$$$::I am inquiring on behalf of a noble."[lr]::
11412::$$$message_0091_0018_0004$$$::"Yes, we have these on our catalog in stock..."::
11413::$$$message_0091_0019_0000$$$::"...Um, excuse me?"[lr]::
11414::$$$message_0091_0019_0001$$$::"Yes, which item would you like?"[lr]::
11415::$$$message_0091_0019_0002$$$::"What is with this price?"[lr]::
11416::$$$message_0091_0019_0003$$$::"I can give you a small discount."::
11417::$$$message_0091_0020_0000$$$::"Can you not joke around please?"[lr]::
11418::$$$message_0091_0020_0001$$$::"What?"::
11419::$$$message_0091_0021_0000$$$::"Are you telling me to put an item as cheap as this on the table of my incomparable noble lady?[lr]::
11420::$$$message_0091_0021_0001$$$::Are you trying to humiliate me as a servant that does not know the status of the master that I serve?"::
11421::$$$message_0091_0022_0000$$$::"Oh... This is our most expensive item in our store..."[lr]::
11422::$$$message_0091_0022_0001$$$::"Then, I decline! [lr]::
11423::$$$message_0091_0022_0002$$$::Why do I have to do such a thing... This is all because of that duo with superhuman strength that breaks plates like they're eggshells![lr]::
11424::$$$message_0091_0022_0003$$$::...Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhh."[wvs][wm canskip=0][se storage=se548.wav]::
11425::$$$message_0091_0023_0000$$$::"...I wonder why someone who's serving such a noble household is at such an ordinary shopping district."[lr]::
11426::$$$message_0091_0023_0001$$$::"Well, even the former princess comes here."[lr]::
11427::$$$message_0091_0023_0002$$$::"Come to think of it, the former king does come to buy sweets too."[lr]::
11428::$$$message_0091_0023_0003$$$::"That is not all. There are other troubling customers..."::
11429::$$$message_0091_0024_0000$$$::"Excuse me? I think that incense burner is a celadon from the Meiji era, but do you think it's real? I wonder if there is a certificate of authenticity."[lr]::
11430::$$$message_0091_0024_0001$$$::"...U-Um..."::
11431::$$$message_0091_0025_0000$$$::"I don't think so. It's probably a replica from a later period.[lr]::
11432::$$$message_0091_0025_0001$$$::Besides, whoever fixed it with gold paint has bad taste, and incense burners don't go for as much nowadays. Although we still use one for work."::
11433::$$$message_0091_0026_0000$$$::"You are slightly superior when it comes to this. I won't lose when it comes to paintings...[lr]::
11434::$$$message_0091_0026_0001$$$::I see, interesting. I feel like I can enjoy myself for a while just by researching the authenticity and origin of these items."::
11435::$$$message_0091_0027_0000$$$::"Ah, that is[line len=2][lr]::
11436::$$$message_0091_0027_0001$$$::M-Miss, please do not do that!"[lr]::
11437::$$$message_0091_0027_0002$$$::"Well, what did you do while I wasn't watching?"[lr]::
11438::$$$message_0091_0027_0003$$$::"Guh... I-I'm not hiding anything."::
11439::$$$message_0091_0028_0000$$$::"What did you put into the drawer of that dresser?"[lr]::
11440::$$$message_0091_0028_0001$$$::"Tsk, [cacheimage storage=蒔寺私服03c(遠)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 storage=蒔寺私服03c(遠) time=200]isn't it fine to keep it a little longer?[lr]::
11441::$$$message_0091_0028_0002$$$::Right, clerk? You'll forgive my mischief 'cause I'm cute, right?"[lr]::
11442::$$$message_0091_0028_0003$$$::"No... That is..."::
11443::$$$message_0091_0029_0000$$$::"Hey, don't trouble the clerk. You should just ask her to put it on hold for you."[lr]::
11444::$$$message_0091_0029_0001$$$::"But...if she sees it, I bet she'd spend like 500,000 yen just to snatch it away.[lr]::
11445::$$$message_0091_0029_0002$$$::Geez, rich people are so open about what they do."[wvs][se storage=se548.wav]::
11446::$$$message_0091_0030_0000$$$::"...And so on."[lr]::
11447::$$$message_0091_0030_0001$$$::"Wow, you've got some odd customers. I wonder who they could be."[lr]::
11448::$$$message_0091_0030_0002$$$::"Well, you are surprisingly dull-witted."::
11449::$$$message_0091_0031_0000$$$::"Customer service is rough, but it's all a matter of getting used to it.[lr]::
11450::$$$message_0091_0031_0001$$$::You just have to endure it, Rider."[lr]::
11451::$$$message_0091_0031_0002$$$::"Yes..."[lr]::
11452::$$$message_0091_0031_0003$$$::I want to pat her on the shoulder to make her feel better, but I can't quite pull it off since she's tall.::
11453::$$$message_0091_0032_0000$$$::"Heheheh, I'm glad I'm a customer."[lr]::
11454::$$$message_0091_0032_0001$$$::"Yes, you have it good, Caster."[lr]::
11455::$$$message_0091_0032_0002$$$::Her reproachful glare goes past me and digs into Caster.::
11456::$$$message_0091_0033_0000$$$::"The way that you say that bothers me."[lr]::
11457::$$$message_0091_0033_0001$$$::"I said you need to endure troubling customers, Ri[line len=2][cacheimage storage=キャスターローブ無し02g(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][textoff][chgfg time=200 storage=キャスターローブ無し02g(中)][wait canskip=0 time=300][se storage=se350.wav][quake vmax=15 hmax=15 time=2000][sestop storage=se350.wav time=2000 nowait=1]mrrghgrblrghlrmrhliblrgh!?"[se volume=60 storage=se072.wav][wait canskip=0 time=600][stopquake][shock vmax=30 time=600 count=6][se storage=se211.wav]::
11458::$$$message_0091_0034_0000$$$::"You must have an elegant life as a housewife watching reruns of shows while eating rice crackers and going to the tennis club."[lr]::
11459::$$$message_0091_0034_0001$$$::"...What a way to say it."::
11460::$$$message_0091_0035_0000$$$::"It's spot on, right?"[lr]::
11461::$$$message_0091_0035_0001$$$::"No, I am more jealous of you from hearing what you said.[lr]::
11462::$$$message_0091_0035_0002$$$::You can just rely on the manager if something happens."::
11463::$$$message_0091_0036_0000$$$::"Hm."[lr]::
11464::$$$message_0091_0036_0001$$$::"On the other hand, all the responsibility falls onto the housewife.[lr]::
11465::$$$message_0091_0036_0002$$$::Ugh, it really isn't easy..."::
11466::$$$message_0091_0037_0000$$$::"Does Mr. Kuzuki have a lot of requests at home?"[lr]::
11467::$$$message_0091_0037_0001$$$::"Souichirou is fine.[lr]::
11468::$$$message_0091_0037_0002$$$::That person is self-possessed and is dependable as a partner."[lr]::
11469::$$$message_0091_0037_0003$$$::"...I would like for you to take your bragging elsewhere... What is the problem then?"::
11470::$$$message_0091_0038_0000$$$::"...............[wait canskip=0 time=500][say storage=cty0104_cas_0180 name=キャスター]My sister-in-law."::
11471::$$$message_0091_0039_0000$$$::"Ahh, so Mr. Kuzuki has a mother and older sister."[lr]::
11472::$$$message_0091_0039_0001$$$::"An older sister... That is not appealing."[lr]::
11473::$$$message_0091_0039_0002$$$::"No, Souichirou has no family.[lr]::
11474::$$$message_0091_0039_0003$$$::But it's similar to a sister-in-law..."::
11475::$$$message_0091_0040_0000$$$::"Ms. Caster, do you have a moment?"[lr]::
11476::$$$message_0091_0040_0001$$$::"Yes, what is it?"[lr]::
11477::$$$message_0091_0040_0002$$$::"There is dust piling up on the frame of this door. I would like for you to thoroughly clean here as well.[lr]::
11478::$$$message_0091_0040_0003$$$::I am leaving Souichirou's area up to you, so I shall be respectful. If Emiya had cleaned this, there would be no such oversight."[lr]::
11479::$$$message_0091_0040_0004$$$::"...Yes."::
11480::$$$message_0091_0041_0000$$$::"What is this miso soup, Ms. Caster!?"[lr]::
11481::$$$message_0091_0041_0001$$$::"W-What was wrong with it!?"[lr]::
11482::$$$message_0091_0041_0002$$$::"Souichirou's miso soup has to be white miso and soup stock made from kelp.[lr]::
11483::$$$message_0091_0041_0003$$$::The vulgar taste of red miso and soup stock made from dried sardines without the insides removed? Are you thinking of having Souichirou drink such a thing!?"[lr]::
11484::$$$message_0091_0041_0004$$$::"Eek, I am sorry!"::
11485::$$$message_0091_0042_0000$$$::"Geez, compared to Emiya's, your miso soup is like a weird Westernized imitation![lr]::
11486::$$$message_0091_0042_0001$$$::Emiya's miso soup is the ultimate origin of Japanese taste that interweaves bonito soup stock, combined miso, and firm tofu![lr]::
11487::$$$message_0091_0042_0002$$$::Yes, compared to that, it reveals your upbringing as a country bumpkin by the Black Sea nibbling on rye bread and slurping on rock salt cabbage soup!"[lr]::
11488::$$$message_0091_0042_0003$$$::"Yes, I am sorry..."::
11489::$$$message_0091_0043_0000$$$::"What is this laundry, Caster!?"[lr]::
11490::$$$message_0091_0043_0001$$$::"U-Um..."[lr]::
11491::$$$message_0091_0043_0002$$$::"Souichirou's shirt should not have a single stain, and you must iron and starch the collar, yet I found this wrinkle[line len=2]how disappointing, learn from Emiya!"[lr]::
11492::$$$message_0091_0043_0003$$$::"Oof..."::
11493::$$$message_0091_0044_0000$$$::"What is with that look!?[lr]::
11494::$$$message_0091_0044_0001$$$::Despite how Emiya looks, he irons his shirts and always brushes his uniform.[lr]::
11495::$$$message_0091_0044_0002$$$::On the other hand, you have left Souichirou's suit there. The fabric will get damaged! Suits are living creatures that breathe!"[lr]::
11496::$$$message_0091_0044_0003$$$::"I-I'm sor[line len=2]"::
11497::$$$message_0091_0045_0000$$$::"Give me that. It was foolish of me to think that since you know how to handle the Golden Fleece, it would be the same for Merino wool![lr]::
11498::$$$message_0091_0045_0001$$$::I shall take care of Souichirou's clothes from now on! Step aside, you country bumpkin!"[lr]::
11499::$$$message_0091_0045_0002$$$::"I'm sorry, I'm sorry, please forgive me."::
11500::$$$message_0091_0046_0000$$$::"I shall tell Souichirou about all of this. You are not worthy for that man, so pack up your things and go back to that kolkhoz of the Black Sea coast that reeks of potatoes!"[lr]::
11501::$$$message_0091_0046_0001$$$::"Ah, I beg of you, Issei..."::
11502::$$$message_0091_0047_0000$$$::"I cannot talk to Souichirou of such humiliation...[lr]::
11503::$$$message_0091_0047_0001$$$::Are you saying that you're jealous of such ways of a housewife!?"::
11504::$$$message_0091_0048_0000$$$::"Wait, why did I keep on hearing my name?"[lr]::
11505::$$$message_0091_0048_0001$$$::Also, the latter half was so bizarre that I can't imagine Issei saying it.::
11506::$$$message_0091_0049_0000$$$::"Heh, it is much easier since you only have to deal with Issei."[lr]::
11507::$$$message_0091_0049_0001$$$::"How dare you, underhanded bullying that increases behind closed doors is unbearable."::
11508::$$$message_0091_0050_0000$$$::"I have experienced such an environment from my two older sisters.[lr]::
11509::$$$message_0091_0050_0001$$$::But that is what family is."[lr]::
11510::$$$message_0091_0050_0002$$$::"I don't know about that. If they were really family, they would help me out. Like my little brother."[lr]::
11511::$$$message_0091_0050_0003$$$::"Oh no, things are starting to get uncomfortable again..."::
11512::$$$message_0091_0051_0000$$$::...Then, [wait canskip=0 time=500][se storage=se548.wav]at that moment!::
11513::$$$message_0091_0052_0000$$$::"Ho awn, you hoo, munch, munch."[lr]::
11514::$$$message_0091_0052_0001$$$::Saber...[wait canskip=0 time=400]don't talk with things in your mouth.::
11515::$$$message_0091_0053_0000$$$::"Hnng... [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服12c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 storage=セイバー私服12c(中) last=セイバーfd特殊03_大判a(中) time=300]I would like some tea, but I shall have it later.[lr]::
11516::$$$message_0091_0053_0001$$$::Now. This is a place where people at the shopping district come to relax, you two. It is not a place to fight."[lr]::
11517::$$$message_0091_0053_0002$$$::Saber continues talking without any shame.[lr]::
11518::$$$message_0091_0053_0003$$$::Rider and Caster are both at a loss for words.::
11519::$$$message_0091_0054_0000$$$::"While having some obanyaki first...[wvl canskip=0 time=400]no, [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服02c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 storage=セイバー私服02c(中) time=300]never mind that.[lr]::
11520::$$$message_0091_0054_0001$$$::I was listening to your conversation. I think that each of your individual worries are deep."[lr]::
11521::$$$message_0091_0054_0002$$$::"Are you also trying to butt in?"::
11522::$$$message_0091_0055_0000$$$::"Living and working are both tough. There must be things that do not go as you wish.[lr]::
11523::$$$message_0091_0055_0001$$$::However, your own burden will feel heavier than anyone else's. You cannot get that wrong."::
11524::$$$message_0091_0056_0000$$$::"I am sure the customers and Issei do not mean any harm.[lr]::
11525::$$$message_0091_0056_0001$$$::They are trying their best in their own ways, so sensing that and practicing self-restraint everyday is what is important."[lr]::
11526::$$$message_0091_0056_0002$$$::"...I see."::
11527::$$$message_0091_0057_0000$$$::"Whether you are a housewife or work at an antique shop, you should be able to connect with the other person if you act with sincerity.[lr]::
11528::$$$message_0091_0057_0001$$$::The necessary steps to world peace and governing a nation are here[line len=2]"::
11529::$$$message_0091_0058_0000$$$::Being swallowed by the spirit of Saber's speech, the two that were fighting until now are unbelievably quiet.[lr]::
11530::$$$message_0091_0058_0001$$$::She is the magnificent vessel of a king.::
11531::$$$message_0091_0059_0000$$$::"As expected of you, Saber. I'm seeing you in a new light."[lr]::
11532::$$$message_0091_0059_0001$$$::"No, no. It is nothing much.[lr]::
11533::$$$message_0091_0059_0002$$$::I am glad that things were able to be settled peacefully."::
11534::$$$message_0091_0060_0000$$$::Yeah, a positive spirit like that should eventually lead to good results.[lr]::
11535::$$$message_0091_0060_0001$$$::Caster and Rider seem to be convinced, as they look at each other reluctantly and make up...[lr]::
11536::$$$message_0091_0060_0002$$$::...but before that, they both stare at Saber.::
11537::$$$message_0091_0061_0000$$$::"Can I ask you one thing first?"[lr]::
11538::$$$message_0091_0061_0001$$$::"Yes, ask me anything."::
11539::$$$message_0091_0062_0000$$$::"What do you usually do?[lr]::
11540::$$$message_0091_0062_0001$$$::May you tell us along with your valuable opinion?"[lr]::
11541::$$$message_0091_0062_0002$$$::"..."::
11542::$$$message_0091_0063_0000$$$::"Saber doesn't do anything."[lr]::
11543::$$$message_0091_0063_0001$$$::"Wha[line len=2]Rider!"::
11544::$$$message_0091_0064_0000$$$::"Right, Shirou?"[lr]::
11545::$$$message_0091_0064_0001$$$::Rider stares at me.[lr]::
11546::$$$message_0091_0064_0002$$$::It's through her glasses, but her Mystic Eyes are fired up[line len=2]::
11547::$$$message_0091_0065_0000$$$::"So just a freeloader?"[lr]::
11548::$$$message_0091_0065_0001$$$::"Yes, she's a freeloader that doesn't hesitate to ask for thirds."[lr]::
11549::$$$message_0091_0065_0002$$$::"And she's lecturing us?"::
11550::$$$message_0091_0066_0000$$$::"Hold on,[wvl canskip=0 time=300] um, [wvl canskip=0 time=300]you're both forgetting your individual duties![lr]::
11551::$$$message_0091_0066_0001$$$::We are Servants before we are a store clerk, housewife, or freeloader.[lr]::
11552::$$$message_0091_0066_0002$$$::Our duty is to fight, and it is not wrong to rest up and recharge[line len=2]"::
11553::$$$message_0091_0067_0000$$$::"Why don't you at least job hunt?[lr]::
11554::$$$message_0091_0067_0001$$$::Don't you think anything seeing me work?"[lr]::
11555::$$$message_0091_0067_0002$$$::"I have a humble suggestion as a former princess that you should try to understand the lives of the common people a bit more as the king."[lr]::
11556::$$$message_0091_0067_0003$$$::Man, they're mad. They're both merciless.::
11557::$$$message_0091_0068_0000$$$::"Heh, [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3]what are you two saying?[lr]::
11558::$$$message_0091_0068_0001$$$::That is why I am on a patrol, while eating obanyaki, to know the lives of the common people!"::
11559::$$$message_0091_0069_0000$$$::"Eating while walking is disgraceful, so please stop it."[lr]::
11560::$$$message_0091_0069_0001$$$::"You should reexamine your own life before others'."::
11561::$$$message_0091_0070_0000$$$::"W-What are you saying I should do?"[lr]::
11562::$$$message_0091_0070_0001$$$::"Even if you are a Servant, why don't you try engaging yourself in something a bit more productive?"[lr]::
11563::$$$message_0091_0070_0002$$$::"Yes, real-world experience. Be my exclusive model then. I shall dress you in my collection every day."::
11564::$$$message_0091_0071_0000$$$::"...There's a limit to how unproductive one can be.[lr]::
11565::$$$message_0091_0071_0001$$$::Lessons should be learned through personal experience, but I don't know about traumatizing someone so naïve with some shady recruitment practices."::
11566::$$$message_0091_0072_0000$$$::"Heh, I'm not inviting a big woman like you to be my model."[lr]::
11567::$$$message_0091_0072_0001$$$::"Says the woman well past her prime."::
11568::$$$message_0091_0073_0000$$$::"How dare you. Did you think I wouldn't hear you?[lr]::
11569::$$$message_0091_0073_0001$$$::Unfortunately for you, these pointed ears aren't just for show."[lr]::
11570::$$$message_0091_0073_0002$$$::"Ugh, you two...!"::
11571::$$$message_0091_0074_0000$$$::An intense battle hitting each other's vital spots, both sides making clean hits at each other's shins.[lr]::
11572::$$$message_0091_0074_0001$$$::Saber will explode at this rate, and the shopping district will become a scene of carnage where the three big Servants fly wildly about in fierce battle...!::
11573::$$$message_0091_0075_0000$$$::"Hnng, hnng..."[lr]::
11574::$$$message_0091_0075_0001$$$::"You there! Don't run away just because it got awkward!"[lr]::
11575::$$$message_0091_0075_0002$$$::"...Well, I guess it's fine."[lr]::
11576::$$$message_0091_0075_0003$$$::There's no tension at all.[lr]::
11577::$$$message_0091_0075_0004$$$::Geez, I can't tell if they're close or not...::

